      "content": "okay but i dont think i'm \"dangerously\" low, i just feel really drained and the cramps are making it hard to move. i've heard athletes use potassium to prevent crashing after long sessions. is 2000mg really that much of a risk if i just take it with a big glass of water and some food? i really dont want to go to the er just for some cramps.",
