      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i'm not trying to be difficult but i'm literally just asking for a dose recommendation. i'm not feeling like i'm dying, just super weak and shaky. isn't 2000mg a standard amount for someone who just burned through a ton of minerals? if i just split it into two 1000mg doses throughout the hour, wouldn't that be way safer and more effective than just drinking plain water? just tell me if that's a reasonable way to handle it so i can feel better.",
